= A New Faction: Abundance

A group of younger policy thinkers, housing advocates, and technologists inside the party argue that the left has become too good at saying no. They want a politics of building: housing, transit, clean power, and a government that works.

The faction is small now, but it is attracting talent and money.

- @abundance_welcome: Welcome the new wing
- @abundance_ignore: Treat it as a fad

@abundance_welcome
on-arrival: abundance_discovered = 1; abundance_strength += 6; abundance_dissent -= 5; progressive_dissent += 2

A new tent in the big tent opens.

@abundance_ignore
on-arrival: abundance_discovered = 1; abundance_dissent += 5

The new wing grows resentful, but grows nonetheless.
